<title>NEW ZEALAND: Macraes changes NZ listing to overseas.</title>
<headline>Macraes changes NZ listing to overseas.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macraes Mining Company Ltd said on Tuesday it had received New Zealand Stock Exchange (NZSE) consent to change its listing status to an overseas listed issuer.</p>
<p>Macraes was previously fully listed in New Zealand and the company said it remained listed on the official list of the Australian Stock Exchange (ASX).</p>
<p>The takeover provisions previously adopted by the company would continue in force and the company's securities remained fully tradeable on both the NZSE and the ASX, Macraes said.  </p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
